# Festival of Embers: "During your turn". Bot1's Lightning Bolt is in its graveyard with Festival of Embers on the battlefield and a Mountain untapped, but on
# Bot2's turn 4 the Bolt cannot be cast from there (it is an instant, so only the permission's "your turn" stops it); on Bot1's own turn 5 it can, for {R} and
# 1 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Festival of Embers
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

